 "titulo": "You built a wood stove chimney 🔥 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "YOU BUILT A CHIMNEY",
 "descripcion": "From a fire on the floor to a chimney that pulls smoke out, stays out of the wind and doesn't burn your roof, one problem at a time.\n\nWhat should we build next?\n\n#engineering #chimney #woodstove #fire #shorts",
